sed":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/InternRobotics/NavDP/issues/66/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/InternRobotics/NavDP/issues/61","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/InternRobotics/NavDP","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/InternRobotics/NavDP/issues/61/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/InternRobotics/NavDP/issues/61/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/InternRobotics/NavDP/issues/61/events","html_url":"https://github.com/InternRobotics/NavDP/issues/61","id":3698908704,"node_id":"I_kwDOOrF2387ceN4g","number":61,"title":"Request for EgoPlanner Baseline Code","user":{"login":"Zeying-Gong","id":33891094,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODkxMDk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33891094?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zeying-Gong","html_url":"https://github.com/Zeying-Gong","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zeying-Gong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zeying-Gong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zeying-Gong/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zeying-Gong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zeying-Gong/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zeying-Gong/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zeying-Gong/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zeying-Gong/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zeying-Gong/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-12-05T13:01:23Z","updated_at":"2025-12-05T13:01:23Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Dear NavDP Team,\n\nI've been exploring the NavDP repository and found the work on navigation diffusion policies quite impressive, especially the comprehensive benchmarking of various baselines.\n\nI noticed that in Table 3 of your paper, EgoPlanner is included as one of the baselines. However, after checking the repository, I couldn't find the related code or implementation for EgoPlanner, while other baselines mentioned in the table (such as iPlanner, ViPlanner, GNM, etc.) have their code provided.\n\nCould you please let me know if there are plans to release the EgoPlanner baseline code? It would be extremely helpful for comparative studies and further research in the field.\n\nThank you for your time and the valuable work you've shared.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/InternRobotics/NavDP/issues/61/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/InternRobotics/NavDP/issues/61/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/InternRobotics/NavDP/issues/58","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/InternRobotics/NavDP","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/InternRobotics/NavDP/issues/58/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/InternRobotics/NavDP/issues/58/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/InternRobotics/NavDP/issues/58/events","html_url":"https://github.com/InternRobotics/NavDP/issues/58","id":3646368611,"node_id":"I_kwDOOrF2387ZVytj","number":58,"title":"[BUG] Memory Overflow and Thread Error in `MWF4WLIKTIFZIAABAAAAADY8_usd` Scene","user":{"login":"zhanglixuan0720","id":44504765,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTA0NzY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44504765?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglixuan0720","html_url":"https://github.com/zhanglixuan0720","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglixuan0720/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglixuan0720/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglixuan0720/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglixuan0720/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglixuan0720/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglixuan0720/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglixuan0720/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglixuan0720/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhanglixuan0720/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-11-20T09:37:32Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T07:40:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"\n\n\n**Description**:\nI encountered an issue when testing the NavDP model with the `MWF4WLIKTIFZIAABAAAAADY8_usd` scene in `scenes_commercial`. The memory usage spikes to 80GB during the test, whereas other scenes only use around 10GB. After this, the following errors appear:\n\n```\n2025-11-20 08:11:29 [1,286,639ms] [Warning] [omni.ujitso] UJITSO : Build storage validation failed for Storage status: 1\nhttp://localhost:8002/navigator_reset\nNo trajectory available, using zero action\nNo trajectory available, using zero action\nNo trajectory available, using zero action   [ERROR:0@1278.827] global parallel_impl.cpp:244 WorkerThread 54: Can't spawn new thread: res[0/1840]\nLLVM ERROR: out of memory\n[ERROR:0@1278.827] global parallel_impl.cpp:244 WorkerThread 55: Can't spawn new thread: res = 11\n[ERROR:0@1278.829] global parallel_impl.cpp:244 WorkerThread 56: Can't spawn new thread: res = 11\n[ERROR:0@1278.829] global parallel_impl.cpp:244 WorkerThread 57: Can't spawn new thread: res = 11\n[ERROR:0@1278.829] global parallel_impl.cpp:244 WorkerThread 58: Can't spawn new thread: res = 11\n[ERROR:0@1278.829] global parallel_impl.cpp:244 WorkerThread 59: Can't spawn new thread: res = 11\nLLVM ERROR: out of memory\nAborted (core dumped)\n```\n\n**Steps to Reproduce**:\n\n1. Clone the NavDP repository and set up the environment.\n2. Download and set up the `scenes_commercial/MWF4WLIKTIFZIAABAAAAADY8_usd` scene \n3. Run the model with the  `scenes_commercial/MWF4WLIKTIFZIAABAAAAADY8_usd` scene using the following command:\n\n   ```\n   python eval_pointgoal_wheeled.py --port 8000 --scene_dir assets/scenes/internscenes_commercial/scenes_commercial --scene_index 17 --scene_scale 0.01 \n   ```\nThe modefied part of `eval_pointgoal_wheeled.py` is as follows:\n```python\nall_scenes = sorted(os.listdir(args_cli.scene_dir))\nscene_path = os.path.join(args_cli.scene_dir,all_scenes[args_cli.scene_index]) + \"/\"\n```\n\n4. Observe the error and the program aborts.\n\n\n**Additional Information**:\n\n* This issue only occurs in the `MWF4WLIKTIFZIAABAAAAADY8_usd` scene. Other scenes, like those in the `cluttered_easy` or `internscenes_commercial` directories, do not show this behavior.\n* It appears to be related to the memory management or threading during the model's operation.\n\n**Environment**:\n\n* Operating System: Ubuntu 22.04.5 LTS\n* GPU: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\n* Memory:  1 TB\n\n**Request**:\nCould you please advise on possible solutions for this issue?  Any suggestions for addressing this issue would be appreciated.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":